After years of delays and more than a billion dollars, the long-awaited Lucas Museum of Narrative Art is preparing to open its doors to the public in Los Angeles. The museum, founded by filmmaker George Lucas and his wife, businesswoman Mellody Hobson, will be a new home for visual storytelling spanning the Star Wars universe and beyond. FRANCE 24's correspondent Wassim Cornet reports.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/f8e4b760-a79c-11f1-8dcb-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/063-2293254499.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/f8e4b760-a79c-11f1-8dcb-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/063-2293254499.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">59dccbe4-a85f-11f1-b0b5-6be82c255321</guid><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 13:57:54 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>UK reasserts Falklands sovereignty amid Milei claim and Trump comments</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260904-uk-reasserts-falklands-sovereignty-amid-milei-claim-and-trump-comments</link><description>
Britain insisted Friday that the Falkland Islands "are British" after Argentine President Javier Milei suggested the "winds of change" now favoured his country's claim to the archipelago, citing Washington's readiness to reconsider its neutrality in the dispute. The islands' fate returned to the headlines after US President Donald Trump threatened to wade into the dispute, while a British-Israeli oil project near the islands stoked anger in Argentina. FRANCE 24's London correspondent, Bénédicte Paviot, gives an inside look at Downing Street's reaction to these developments.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/308340e0-a85d-11f1-bdc2-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-5628432606a9abb31f0c691-48985642.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/308340e0-a85d-11f1-bdc2-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-5628432606a9abb31f0c691-48985642.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">de6c37e8-a84e-11f1-833b-8f48c4c4a151</guid><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 12:44:49 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Reporters</category><title>US state of Louisiana in battle over electoral map</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/reporters/20260904-us-state-of-louisiana-in-battle-over-electoral-map-midterm-elections</link><description>
